            "detailed_description": "Armored Freedom is an intense strategy board game where giant robots fight for dominance. <br />\r\nRoll the dice to charge and wage war using battle cards. Unveil hidden secrets within special action cards. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nArmored Freedom takes place in a world where wars are fought with giant mechs. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nRoll the dice to move your mechs and crush your enemies with battle cards in turn-based, boardgame-style gameplay.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFight across four distinctive terrains: forest, desert, snow and minimalistic &quot;zen&quot; style boards.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCustomize your pilot and mech. Increase your rank and win medals. Unlock unique items and recruit heroes with special abilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWage epic single and multiplayer battles across four different gameplay modes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEntrust your freedom to heavy armor in single-player and multiplayer matches.",
